se\">]</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\" columnlines=\"none solid\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>:=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\" columnlines=\"none solid\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, we have the system</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"79\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7B TEX-S3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 5.573em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-bottom: 0.1em;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\